If node <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_k"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> has <b>zero</b> incoming edges (except from Start) and <b>zero</b> outgoing edges, this request is isolated and cannot be merged. The entire trip is invalid.</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="16"><h3 data-path-to-node="17">Part 2: The Vehicle Filter (Candidate Intersection)</h3><p data-path-to-node="18">You correctly noted: <i>"Remember a graph is only valid for a certain set of vehicles."</i></p><p data-path-to-node="19">Each Global Trip object must store a set of <b>Candidate Vehicles</b> (<span class="math-inline" data-math="V_{cand}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.2222em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">c</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">an</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>).
When we merge Trip A and Trip B to form Trip C:
</p><div data-path-to-node="20"><div class="math-block" data-math="V_{cand}(C) = V_{cand}(A) \cap V_{cand}(B)"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.2222em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">c</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">an</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0715em;">C</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.2222em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">c</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">an</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∩</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.2222em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">c</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">an</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><p data-path-to-node="21">If <span class="math-inline" data-math="V_{cand}(C)"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.2222em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">c</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">an</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0715em;">C</span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span> is empty, we discard the graph immediately. We don't even calculate the matrix.</p><hr data-path-to-node="22"><h3 data-path-to-node="23">Part 3: Inserting Vehicle Stops (The "Contextual" Graph)</h3><p data-path-to-node="24">This is the most powerful part of your idea. When <span class="math-inline" data-math="V_{cand}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;">V</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.2222em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">c</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">an</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> becomes small (or size 1), or when we are ready to calculate the final cost, we <b>inject</b> the vehicle's state into the graph.</p><h4 data-path-to-node="25">The Concept</h4><p data-path-to-node="26">A vehicle <span class="math-inline" data-math="v"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0359em;">v</span></span></span></span></span> is not just a point in space; it is a <b>Chain of Hard Constraints</b>:
</p><div data-path-to-node="27"><div class="math-block" data-math="v_{loc} \to S_{v1} \to S_{v2} \dots \to S_{vn}"><span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.5806em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0359em;">v</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0359em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0197em;">l</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0359em;">v</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0359em;">v</span><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner">⋯</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0359em;">v</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><p data-path-to-node="28">
where <span class="math-inline" data-math="S_{vi}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0359em;">v</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> are the passengers currently on board. They <i>must</i> be visited, usually in a fixed order (or a very tightly constrained order).</p><h4 data-path-to-node="29">The Injection Algorithm</h4><p data-path-to-node="30">We treat the vehicle's existing stops as <b>Fixed Nodes</b> in our graph that block connectivity.</p><p data-path-to-node="31">Let the new request nodes be <span class="math-inline" data-math="N_{new}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.109em;">N</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.109em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0269em;">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.
Let the vehicle's fixed path be <span class="math-inline" data-math="P = (p_0, p_1, \dots, p_n)"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">P</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner">…</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span>.</p><p data-path-to-node="32">We update our Reachability Matrix <span class="math-inline" data-math="M"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.109em;">M</span></span></span></span></span> by restricting edges based on <b>Slack</b>:</p><p data-path-to-node="33"><b>1. The "Gap" Logic</b>
Instead of just checking time windows, we check if a transition fits into the <b>Slack</b> of the vehicle's schedule.</p><p data-path-to-node="34">For an edge <span class="math-inline" data-math="u \to v"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0359em;">v</span></span></span></span></span> in our Trip Graph to be valid for Vehicle <span class="math-inline" data-math="V"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;">V</span></span></span></span></span>, it must fit into a specific "Gap" in the vehicle's path, or extend the path.</p><p data-path-to-node="35"><b>2. Pruning via Slack</b>
For every edge <span class="math-inline" data-math="u \to v"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">u</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0359em;">v</span></span></span></span></span> in the Global Graph, we refine the weight <span class="math-inline" data-math="M_{uv}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.109em;">M</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.109em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0359em;">uv</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>:
$$ M_{uv}^{(vehicle)} = \begin{cases}
\tau(u, v) &amp; \text{if } \exists k : \text{Insert}(u, v) \text{ fits in Gap}_k \
\infty &amp; \text{otherwise}
\end{cases} $$</p><p data-path-to-node="36"><b>3. The Anchor Node</b>
We add a virtual Source Node <span class="math-inline" data-math="S"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span></span></span></span></span> representing the vehicle's current position <span class="math-inline" data-math="p_0"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">p</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p><ul data-path-to-node="37"><li><p data-path-to-node="37,0,0">Edges <span class="math-inline" data-math="S \to O_i"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> are valid only if the vehicle can reach <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_i"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <i>now</i>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="37,1,0">If the vehicle is "locked" serving passenger A, edge <span class="math-inline" data-math="S \to O_B"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> might be invalid until <span class="math-inline" data-math="D_A"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> is reached.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="38">Mathematical Summary for Implementation</h3><p data-path-to-node="39">Here is the Pythonic logic for the class structure you should build:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4195179700="" class="ng-tns-c4195179700-15 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4195179700-15 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f5a982b7f49a8e0e&quot;,&quot;c_912d96631775c152&quot;,null,&quot;rc_6af04645466e9e16&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="3" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4195179700-15 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="ng-tns-c4195179700-15">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4195179700-15 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4195179700-15 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f5a982b7f49a8e0e&quot;,&quot;c_912d96631775c152&quot;,null,&quot;rc_6af04645466e9e16&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4195179700-15"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4195179700-15"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="ng-tns-c4195179700-15"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4195179700-15"><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">TripGraph</span>:</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title">__init__</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, n_reqs</span>):</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># 2*n_reqs nodes. </span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># Matrix stores float time if edge exists, np.inf if not</span>
        self.matrix = np.full((<span class="hljs-number">2</span>*n_reqs, <span class="hljs-number">2</span>*n_reqs), np.inf)
        self.earliest = np.zeros(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>*n_reqs)
        self.latest = np.zeros(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>*n_reqs)

    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title">add_request</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, new_req, network</span>):</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># 1. Expand Matrix</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># 2. Compute Earliest/Latest for new req based on Universal Bounds</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># 3. Fill edges (Iterate old nodes) checking:</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment">#    Earliest[u] + dist(u, v) &lt;= Latest[v]</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">pass</span>

<span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">ContextualGraph</span>(<span class="hljs-params">TripGraph</span>):</span>
    <span class="hljs-string">"""
    The graph 'collapsed' for a specific vehicle.
    """</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title">__init__</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, global_graph, vehicle</span>):</span>
        self.matrix = global_graph.matrix.copy()
        
        <span class="hljs-comment"># PRUNING:</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># 1. Update 'Earliest' times based on Vehicle's current time/loc</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># 2. Update 'Latest' times based on Vehicle's onboard passenger constraints</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># 3. Remove edges that are now impossible given the tightened windows</span>
        
        mask = (self.earliest[:, <span class="hljs-literal">None</span>] + self.matrix &gt; self.latest[<span class="hljs-literal">None</span>, :])
        self.matrix[mask] = np.inf
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="41">Why this is better</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="42"><li><p data-path-to-node="42,0,0"><b>Lazy Evaluation:</b> You build the "Loose" Global Graph once (cheap). You only do the expensive "Tight" Vehicle Graph checks when you actually attempt an assignment.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="42,1,0"><b>Pre-computation:</b> The Global Graph acts as a bloom filter. If <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_1"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> cannot reach <span class="math-inline" data-math="D_2"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> in the global graph (perfect conditions), it definitely can't do it in the messy vehicle graph.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="42,2,0"><b>Parallelism:</b> You can build Global Graphs for all trip combinations in parallel without locking the Vehicle objects.</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="43">Visualizing the Graph (Mental Model)</h3><p data-path-to-node="44">Imagine the graph for 2 requests (Red, Blue).</p><ul data-path-to-node="45"><li><p data-path-to-node="45,0,0">Nodes: <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_R, D_R, O_B, D_B"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0077em;">R</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0077em;">R</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="45,1,0"><b>Global Graph:</b> Might look like a fully connected mesh (except <span class="math-inline" data-math="D \to O"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span></span></span></span></span>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="45,2,0"><b>Vehicle Arrival:</b> Vehicle is 10 miles away.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="45,3,0"><b>Pruning:</b> <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_R"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0077em;">R</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> is close, <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_B"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> is far.</p><ul data-path-to-node="45,3,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="45,3,1,0,0">The edge <span class="math-inline" data-math="Start \to O_B"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">St</span><span class="mord mathnormal">a</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">r</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> becomes <span class="math-inline" data-math="\infty"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord">∞</span></span></span></span></span> (Vehicle can't get there in time).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="45,3,1,1,0">The solver now is forced to pick path <span class="math-inline" data-math="Start \to O_R \to \dots"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">St</span><span class="mord mathnormal">a</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">r</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0077em;">R</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.123em;"></span><span class="minner">…</span></span></span></span></span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="45,3,1,2,0">The graph "crystallizes" into a specific valid path as constraints are applied.</p></li></ul></li></ul></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2587252621-2"></div></div><!----></response-container><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></share-turn-viewer><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c343160584="" class="ng-tns-c343160584-1 ng-star-inserted"><!----><share-turn-viewer _ngcontent-ng-c343160584="" _nghost-ng-c3025034799="" class="ng-tns-c343160584-1 ng-star-inserted" id="d78e0b0e1d498ee6" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3025034799="" class="share-turn-viewer ng-star-inserted"><user-query _ngcontent-ng-c3025034799="" _nghost-ng-c3843244048="" class="ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3843244048="" class="user-query-container right-align-content"><!----><user-query-content _ngcontent-ng-c3843244048="" class="user-query-container" _nghost-ng-c3253035101="" style="--max-lines-for-collapse-count: 5;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="user-query-container user-query-bubble-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="file-preview-container ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-content ng-star-inserted" id="user-query-content-1" jslog="275422;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ucQahcKEwiJhIuHxqmRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQBg"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" mat-icon-button="" aria-label="Copy prompt" mattooltip="Copy prompt" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger action-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-controls="user-query-content-1" jslog="273008;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d78e0b0e1d498ee6&quot;,&quot;c_912d96631775c152&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-m action-button-icon google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="user-query-bubble-with-background ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="horizontal-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" role="heading" aria-level="2" class="query-text gds-body-l" dir="ltr"><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> That is pretty good. However there is one logical thing I we are missing here. The vehicle insertions does not have to wait to be done after the build out. It could be done as soon as the graph only has one possible vehicle! So it would be nice if our build out process could handle a ContextualGraph and a Trip graph alike! For each iteration we could just solve the extension with the vehicles current stops as well if there is only one vehicle that can serve the graph. That way we prune as soon as possible! <!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> We do not even need to change the graph class. Lets say you just extend it with stops that have constraints. When extending for a given vehicle you would just add the vehicles list of stops. They will be inserted into the graph in the same way as any other request! <!----><!----></p><!----></div><!----><!----><!----></span></span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----></user-query-content></span></user-query><!----><response-container _ngcontent-ng-c3025034799="" class="response-container ng-tns-c2587252621-5 reduced-bottom-padding ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2587252621=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container ng-tns-c2587252621-5 response-container-with-gpi ng-star-inserted" jslog="173900;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQzM4KahcKEwiJhIuHxqmRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQBw"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-header ng-tns-c2587252621-5 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c2587252621-5"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="ng-tns-c2587252621-5 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c2587252621-5"><!----></div></div><!----><tts-control _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" _nghost-ng-c3197637580="" class="ng-tns-c2587252621-5 ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" class="response-tts-container ng-star-inserted" data-test-draft-id="rc_262bf8d566512836" style="height: 3839px;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" data-test-id="disabled-tooltip" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger tts-button-container mat-mdc-tooltip-disabled"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" mat-icon-button="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger tts-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Listen" jslog="184512;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[null,null,null,&quot;rc_262bf8d566512836&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" role="img" fonticon="volume_up" class="mat-icon notranslate icon-filled google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="volume_up"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" role="menu" class="mat-mdc-menu-trigger playback-speed-menu-trigger multi" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false"><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" yposition="below" xposition="after" class=""><!----></mat-menu></div><!----></tts-control><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c2587252621-5"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c2587252621-5"></div></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c2587252621-5" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="avatar-gutter ng-tns-c2587252621-5 ng-star-inserted"><bard-avatar _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="avatar-component ng-tns-c1437199241-6 ng-tns-c2587252621-5 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1437199241=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" bardavataranimationscontroller="" class="bard-avatar ng-tns-c1437199241-6"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" class="avatar-container ng-tns-c1437199241-6"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" class="avatar avatar_primary ng-tns-c1437199241-6 ng-trigger ng-trigger-botAvatarScaleDown ng-star-inserted"><bot-logo _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" class="ng-tns-c1437199241-6 is-dark-mode" _nghost-ng-c1731379540="" style="--bot-logo-size: 32px; --bot-logo-icon-size: 18px; --bot-logo-text: #25B2D4; --bot-logo-bg: #00404E; --bot-logo-border: #00404E;"><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1731379540="" class="bot-logo-text sidenav-style-updates ng-star-inserted" style=""> R <!----><!----></div><!----></bot-logo></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" lottie-animation="" class="avatar_spinner_animation ng-tns-c1437199241-6" style="opacity: 0; visibility: hidden;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="32" height="32" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px); content-visibility: visible;"><defs><clipPath id="__lottie_element_33"><rect width="32" height="32" x="0" y="0"></rect></clipPath><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_37" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_44" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_48" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_52" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_56" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_60" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x1="-16" y1="0" x2="16" y2="0"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="50%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop></linearGradient></defs><g clip-path="url(#__lottie_element_33)"><g transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,16,16)" opacity="1" style="display: block;"><g opacity="1" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)"><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_60)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="2" d=" M-4.383999824523926,-14.347999572753906 C-2.996999979019165,-14.772000312805176 -1.524999976158142,-15 0,-15 C0,-15 0,-15 0,-15 C1.7100000381469727,-15 3.3540000915527344,-14.713000297546387 4.886000156402588,-14.1850004196167"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_56)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_52)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_48)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_44)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_37)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g></g></svg></div></div></bard-avatar><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c2587252621-5"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="bot-name gds-title-s ng-tns-c2587252621-5 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="bot-name-text ng-tns-c2587252621-5"> Ride-Sharing </div><span _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="bot-name-ugc-label ng-tns-c2587252621-5 ng-star-inserted">Custom Gem</span><!----><bot-experiment-badge _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="ng-tns-c2587252621-5" _nghost-ng-c3108469367=""><!----></bot-experiment-badge></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3025034799="" class="message-content ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c793834718=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c793834718="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">This is the final piece of the puzzle to make the architecture "fractal." You are standardizing the concept of a <b>Constraint</b>.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">Whether a node is a "New Request Pickup" or an "Existing Passenger Drop-off," it is just a point in spacetime with precedence rules. By treating them identically, you can indeed prune the graph the moment the <code>candidate_vehicles</code> set drops to size 1.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">We can call this the <b>"Unified Graph Expansion"</b>.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">1. The Mathematical Unification</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">We treat the Graph <span class="math-inline" data-math="G"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">G</span></span></span></span></span> not as "Requests" but as "Stops to be Visited."</p><ul data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0"><b>Request Insertion:</b> Adds 2 nodes <span class="math-inline" data-math="\{O, D\}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">{</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="mclose">}</span></span></span></span></span> with constraint <span class="math-inline" data-math="O \to D"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0"><b>Vehicle Injection:</b> Adds <span class="math-inline" data-math="N"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.109em;">N</span></span></span></span></span> nodes <span class="math-inline" data-math="\{S_1, S_2, \dots S_n\}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">{</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner">…</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">}</span></span></span></span></span> with constraints <span class="math-inline" data-math="S_1 \to S_2 \to \dots \to S_n"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.3669em;"></span><span class="minner">⋯</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="6">In both cases, we use the exact same <code>extend()</code> function. The only difference is the topology of the <b>internal precedence edges</b> we initialize.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="7">2. The Algorithm: Pruning on the Fly</h3><p data-path-to-node="8">Here is your updated build loop. It is aggressive. It doesn't wait for the end to check vehicles.</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="9"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,0,0"><b>Start:</b> <code>G = EmptyGraph</code>, <code>Candidates = AllVehicles</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,0"><b>Loop</b> (Add Request <span class="math-inline" data-math="R_i"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0077em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>):</p><ul data-path-to-node="9,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,0,0"><code>G = G.extend(Nodes=[O_i, D_i], Precedence=[(O_i, D_i)])</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,1,0"><code>Candidates = Candidates</code> <span class="math-inline" data-math="\cap"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.5556em;"></span><span class="mord">∩</span></span></span></span></span> <code>Vehicles_Near(R_i)</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,2,0"><b>The Check:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="9,1,1,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,2,1,0,0">If <code>Candidates</code> is empty <span class="math-inline" data-math="\rightarrow"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.3669em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span></span></span></span></span> <b>Abort Trip</b> (Impossible).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,2,1,1,0">If <code>len(Candidates) == 1</code>:</p><ul data-path-to-node="9,1,1,2,1,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,2,1,1,1,0,0">Let <span class="math-inline" data-math="V = Candidates[0]"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;">V</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0715em;">C</span><span class="mord mathnormal">an</span><span class="mord mathnormal">d</span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span><span class="mord mathnormal">d</span><span class="mord mathnormal">a</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mord mathnormal">es</span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mclose">]</span></span></span></span></span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,2,1,1,1,1,0">Get <span class="math-inline" data-math="V"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;">V</span></span></span></span></span>'s existing stops: <span class="math-inline" data-math="S_{v} = [s_1, s_2, \dots]"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0359em;">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">s</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">s</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner">…</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mclose">]</span></span></span></span></span></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,2,1,1,1,2,0"><b>The Injection:</b> <code>G = G.extend(Nodes=S_v, Precedence=[(s_1, s_2), (s_2, s_3)...])</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,2,1,1,1,3,0">Now <span class="math-inline" data-math="G"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">G</span></span></span></span></span> contains the trip requests <b>AND</b> the vehicle's constraints.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,2,1,1,1,4,0">If <code>G</code> has no valid path <span class="math-inline" data-math="\rightarrow"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.3669em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span></span></span></span></span> <b>Abort Trip</b> (Vehicle fits spatially but can't fit the schedule).</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="10">3. Implementation: The Unified Graph Class</h3><p data-path-to-node="11">We modify <code>extend</code> to accept a generic list of nodes and a list of mandatory precedence tuples.</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4195179700="" class="ng-tns-c4195179700-16 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4195179700-16 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d78e0b0e1d498ee6&quot;,&quot;c_912d96631775c152&quot;,null,&quot;rc_262bf8d566512836&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="3" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4195179700-16 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="ng-tns-c4195179700-16">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4195179700-16 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4195179700-16 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d78e0b0e1d498ee6&quot;,&quot;c_912d96631775c152&quot;,null,&quot;rc_262bf8d566512836&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4195179700-16"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4195179700-16"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="ng-tns-c4195179700-16"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4195179700-16"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> numpy <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> np
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> dataclasses <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> dataclass
<span class="hljs-keyword">from</span> typing <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> List, Tuple, Optional

<span class="hljs-meta">@dataclass</span>
<span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">Stop</span>:</span>
    <span class="hljs-built_in">id</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span>
    location: <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>
    earliest: <span class="hljs-built_in">float</span>
    latest: <span class="hljs-built_in">float</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment"># Helper to distinguish types if needed, but mathematically irrelevant</span>
    <span class="hljs-built_in">type</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span> = <span class="hljs-string">"request"</span> 

<span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">UnifiedGraph</span>:</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title">__init__</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, nodes: List[Stop] = <span class="hljs-literal">None</span>, matrix: np.ndarray = <span class="hljs-literal">None</span></span>):</span>
        self.nodes = nodes <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> nodes <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> []
        <span class="hljs-comment"># Adjacency Matrix: M[i,j] = travel_time if valid, else np.inf</span>
        self.matrix = matrix <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> matrix <span class="hljs-keyword">is</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">not</span> <span class="hljs-literal">None</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> np.zeros((<span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0</span>))

    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title">extend</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, new_nodes: List[Stop], precedence_rules: List[Tuple[<span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>, <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>]], network</span>) -&gt; Optional['UnifiedGraph']:</span>
        <span class="hljs-string">"""
        Generic extender.
        new_nodes: The stops to add (Requests OR Vehicle Stops).
        precedence_rules: List of (u_idx, v_idx) relative to new_nodes list
                          that MUST be respected (e.g., 0-&gt;1 for O-&gt;D).
        """</span>
        n_old = <span class="hljs-built_in">len</span>(self.nodes)
        n_new = <span class="hljs-built_in">len</span>(new_nodes)
        n_total = n_old + n_new
        
        <span class="hljs-comment"># 1. Expand Matrix</span>
        new_mat = np.full((n_total, n_total), np.inf)
        new_mat[:n_old, :n_old] = self.matrix  <span class="hljs-comment"># Copy existing valid edges</span>

        <span class="hljs-comment"># 2. Compute Cross-Edges (Old &lt;-&gt; New)</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># We check feasibility for every combination of Old and New</span>
        full_node_list = self.nodes + new_nodes
        
        <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> i <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(n_total):
            <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> j <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(n_total):
                <span class="hljs-comment"># Skip if already calculated in old matrix</span>
                <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> i &lt; n_old <span class="hljs-keyword">and</span> j &lt; n_old:
                    <span class="hljs-keyword">continue</span>
                
                <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> i == j: <span class="hljs-keyword">continue</span>

                u, v = full_node_list[i], full_node_list[j]
                
                <span class="hljs-comment"># PHYSICAL CHECK: Can we make it in time?</span>
                travel_time = network.get_travel_time(u.location, v.location)
                <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> u.earliest + travel_time &lt;= v.latest:
                    new_mat[i, j] = travel_time

        <span class="hljs-comment"># 3. Apply Internal Precedence (The "Unified" Constraint)</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># For a request, this enforces O-&gt;D.</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># For a vehicle, this enforces S1-&gt;S2-&gt;S3.</span>
        
        <span class="hljs-comment"># Strategy: We assume any order is valid UNLESS blocked by precedence.</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># But wait! For a vehicle path S1-&gt;S2, we usually forbid S2-&gt;S1.</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># So we explicitly KILL backward edges for strict chains.</span>
        
        <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> pre, post <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> precedence_rules:
            <span class="hljs-comment"># Indices are relative to the new_nodes list, so we shift by n_old</span>
            u_idx = n_old + pre
            v_idx = n_old + post
            
            <span class="hljs-comment"># Allow u -&gt; v (already set by loop above if time allows)</span>
            <span class="hljs-comment"># BLOCK v -&gt; u explicitly</span>
            new_mat[v_idx, u_idx] = np.inf 

        <span class="hljs-comment"># 4. Connectivity Check (The "Pruning")</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># If the graph is disconnected (no way to reach a new node), abort early.</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># Simple check: Does every node have at least 1 Incoming and 1 Outgoing edge?</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># (Except theoretical Start/End nodes)</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">not</span> self._is_connected(new_mat):
            <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">None</span>

        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> UnifiedGraph(full_node_list, new_mat)

    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title">_is_connected</span>(<span class="hljs-params">self, mat</span>):</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment"># Quick heuristic or full flow check</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">True</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="13">4. How the "Vehicle Injection" Works</h3><p data-path-to-node="14">When you inject the vehicle, you are effectively adding a <b>"Skeleton"</b> to the graph.</p><p data-path-to-node="15">Suppose you have Requests A and B (nodes <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_A, D_A, O_B, D_B"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>).
The graph is flexible. You can do <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_A \to O_B \to D_A \dots"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner">…</span></span></span></span></span></p><p data-path-to-node="16"><span data-path-to-node="16,0">Suddenly, <code>Candidates</code> drops to just <b>Vehicle V1</b>.
V1 has passengers <span class="math-inline" data-math="P_1"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (dropoff) and <span class="math-inline" data-math="P_2"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (dropoff) on board. The driver is currently driving to <span class="math-inline" data-math="P_1"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.
</span><span data-path-to-node="16,1"><span class="citation-4"></span></span><span data-path-to-node="16,2"><span class="citation-4">Standard logic dictates we shouldn't reorder existing passengers to avoid confusing them (implied by the "maintain order" heuristic in source </span></span><span data-path-to-node="16,3"><span class="citation-4 citation-end-4"><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2271939537=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2271939537="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="1"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></span><span data-path-to-node="16,4">).</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c48347833=""><!----><source-inline-chips _ngcontent-ng-c48347833="" _nghost-ng-c2631690858="" class="ng-star-inserted"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="5"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----></source-inline-chips><!----><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p><p data-path-to-node="17">You call:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4195179700="" class="ng-tns-c4195179700-17 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4195179700-17 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d78e0b0e1d498ee6&quot;,&quot;c_912d96631775c152&quot;,null,&quot;rc_262bf8d566512836&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="6" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4195179700-17 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="ng-tns-c4195179700-17">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4195179700-17 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4195179700-17 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d78e0b0e1d498ee6&quot;,&quot;c_912d96631775c152&quot;,null,&quot;rc_262bf8d566512836&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4195179700-17"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4195179700-17"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="ng-tns-c4195179700-17"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4195179700-17">vehicle_stops = [Stop(loc=P1...), Stop(loc=P2...)]
<span class="hljs-comment"># Enforce P1 -&gt; P2 order</span>
rules = [(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>)] 

new_graph = current_graph.extend(vehicle_stops, rules, network)
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="19"><b>The Result:</b>
The <code>new_graph</code> now has nodes <span class="math-inline" data-math="\{O_A, D_A, O_B, D_B, P_1, P_2\}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">{</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">}</span></span></span></span></span>.
The matrix has heavily populated <span class="math-inline" data-math="\infty"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord">∞</span></span></span></span></span> values because:</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="20"><li><p data-path-to-node="20,0,0"><span class="math-inline" data-math="P_2 \to P_1"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> is <span class="math-inline" data-math="\infty"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord">∞</span></span></span></span></span> (Precedence Rule).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="20,1,0">Edges from <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_A \to P_1"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> might be <span class="math-inline" data-math="\infty"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord">∞</span></span></span></span></span> if <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_A"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> is too far away to catch <span class="math-inline" data-math="P_1"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">P</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1389em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>'s strict deadline.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="21"><b>The "Implicit" Current Position:</b>
You should treating the Vehicle's <b>Current Location</b> as the "Entry Node" (or Start Node) for the graph check. When checking feasibility, you effectively ask: <i>"Is there a path starting at [Vehicle_Current_Loc] that visits all these nodes?"</i></p><p data-path-to-node="22">This unifies the entire process. You never have a separate "Vehicle Assignment" phase. You just have "Graph Expansion," where sometimes the expansion comes from a customer request, and sometimes it comes from the reality of a vehicle's committed schedule.</p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2587252621-5"></div></div><!----></response-container><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></share-turn-viewer><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c343160584="" class="ng-tns-c343160584-1 ng-star-inserted"><!----><share-turn-viewer _ngcontent-ng-c343160584="" _nghost-ng-c3025034799="" class="ng-tns-c343160584-1 ng-star-inserted" id="9479edd882bd02b5" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3025034799="" class="share-turn-viewer ng-star-inserted"><user-query _ngcontent-ng-c3025034799="" _nghost-ng-c3843244048="" class="ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3843244048="" class="user-query-container right-align-content"><!----><user-query-content _ngcontent-ng-c3843244048="" class="user-query-container" _nghost-ng-c3253035101="" style="--max-lines-for-collapse-count: 5;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="user-query-container user-query-bubble-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="file-preview-container ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-content ng-star-inserted" id="user-query-content-2" jslog="275422;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ucQahcKEwiJhIuHxqmRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQCA"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" mat-icon-button="" aria-label="Copy prompt" mattooltip="Copy prompt" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger action-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-controls="user-query-content-2" jslog="273008;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_9479edd882bd02b5&quot;,&quot;c_912d96631775c152&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-m action-button-icon google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="user-query-bubble-with-background ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="horizontal-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" role="heading" aria-level="2" class="query-text gds-body-l" dir="ltr"><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> Cool now I have been grappling with something. How can I update the slack times with back propagation if I do not calculate all feasible routes and back propagate their slack? I will have to find one hamilton path for a graph to know that it is valid, but to backprop the slack I will have to find all! <!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> The backprop does not make sens for a graph. It only makes sens for a permutation!  <!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> And when inserting a vehicle we will need to have all valid permutations of the graph because inserting the vehicles current stops will effect what path is optimal!  <!----><!----></p><!----></div><!----><!----><!----></span></span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----></user-query-content></span></user-query><!----><response-container _ngcontent-ng-c3025034799="" class="response-container ng-tns-c2587252621-7 reduced-bottom-padding ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2587252621=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container ng-tns-c2587252621-7 response-container-with-gpi ng-star-inserted" jslog="173900;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQzM4KahcKEwiJhIuHxqmRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQCQ"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-header ng-tns-c2587252621-7 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c2587252621-7"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="ng-tns-c2587252621-7 tts ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="single-draft-response-container ng-tns-c2587252621-7"><!----></div></div><!----><tts-control _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" _nghost-ng-c3197637580="" class="ng-tns-c2587252621-7 ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" class="response-tts-container ng-star-inserted" data-test-draft-id="rc_0239ea383d66b22a" style="height: 2766px;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" data-test-id="disabled-tooltip" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger tts-button-container mat-mdc-tooltip-disabled"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" mat-icon-button="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger tts-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Listen" jslog="184512;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[null,null,null,&quot;rc_0239ea383d66b22a&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" role="img" fonticon="volume_up" class="mat-icon notranslate icon-filled google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="volume_up"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" role="menu" class="mat-mdc-menu-trigger playback-speed-menu-trigger multi" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false"><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" yposition="below" xposition="after" class=""><!----></mat-menu></div><!----></tts-control><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c2587252621-7"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c2587252621-7"></div></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c2587252621-7" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="avatar-gutter ng-tns-c2587252621-7 ng-star-inserted"><bard-avatar _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="avatar-component ng-tns-c1437199241-8 ng-tns-c2587252621-7 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1437199241=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" bardavataranimationscontroller="" class="bard-avatar ng-tns-c1437199241-8"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" class="avatar-container ng-tns-c1437199241-8"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" class="avatar avatar_primary ng-tns-c1437199241-8 ng-trigger ng-trigger-botAvatarScaleDown ng-star-inserted"><bot-logo _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" class="ng-tns-c1437199241-8 is-dark-mode" _nghost-ng-c1731379540="" style="--bot-logo-size: 32px; --bot-logo-icon-size: 18px; --bot-logo-text: #25B2D4; --bot-logo-bg: #00404E; --bot-logo-border: #00404E;"><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1731379540="" class="bot-logo-text sidenav-style-updates ng-star-inserted" style=""> R <!----><!----></div><!----></bot-logo></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" lottie-animation="" class="avatar_spinner_animation ng-tns-c1437199241-8" style="opacity: 0; visibility: hidden;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="32" height="32" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px); content-visibility: visible;"><defs><clipPath id="__lottie_element_61"><rect width="32" height="32" x="0" y="0"></rect></clipPath><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_65" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_72" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_76" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_80" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_84" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_88" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x1="-16" y1="0" x2="16" y2="0"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="50%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop></linearGradient></defs><g clip-path="url(#__lottie_element_61)"><g transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,16,16)" opacity="1" style="display: block;"><g opacity="1" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)"><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_88)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="2" d=" M-4.383999824523926,-14.347999572753906 C-2.996999979019165,-14.772000312805176 -1.524999976158142,-15 0,-15 C0,-15 0,-15 0,-15 C1.7100000381469727,-15 3.3540000915527344,-14.713000297546387 4.886000156402588,-14.1850004196167"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_84)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_80)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_76)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_72)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_65)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g></g></svg></div></div></bard-avatar><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c2587252621-7"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="bot-name gds-title-s ng-tns-c2587252621-7 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="bot-name-text ng-tns-c2587252621-7"> Ride-Sharing </div><span _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="bot-name-ugc-label ng-tns-c2587252621-7 ng-star-inserted">Custom Gem</span><!----><bot-experiment-badge _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="ng-tns-c2587252621-7" _nghost-ng-c3108469367=""><!----></bot-experiment-badge></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3025034799="" class="message-content ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c793834718=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c793834718="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">You have hit the nail on the head. This is the fundamental trade-off between the <b>Graph representation</b> and the <b>Sequence representation</b>.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">You are absolutely correct: <b>Slack is a property of a sequence (a permutation), not a set (a graph).</b>
In a graph where <span class="math-inline" data-math="A \to B"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="math-inline" data-math="B \to A"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span></span> are both valid edges, node A does not have a single "slack" value. If you visit A first, it has huge slack. If you visit A last, it has zero slack.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">Here is the resolution: <b>Do not try to back-propagate "Slack" on the graph.</b>
Instead, use <b>"Loose Time Windows"</b> for the graph construction, and calculate <b>"Exact Slack"</b> only when you extract a path.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">1. The Two-Layer Architecture</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">You need to separate the <b>Search Space (Graph)</b> from the <b>Solution (Path/Schedule)</b>.</p><h4 data-path-to-node="5">Layer 1: The Trip Graph (The "Might Be Possible" Layer)</h4><p data-path-to-node="6">This is what you build iteratively. It stores <b>feasibility</b>, not optimality.</p><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b>Nodes:</b> Store "Absolute Bounds" (The widest possible window).</p><ul data-path-to-node="7,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,1,0,0"><span class="math-inline" data-math="E_i"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (Earliest): The earliest time the request could possibly start (usually <span class="math-inline" data-math="t_{req}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9012em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">re</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0359em;">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,1,1,0"><span class="math-inline" data-math="L_i"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (Latest): The absolute latest deadline (<span class="math-inline" data-math="t_{req} + \Omega"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9012em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">re</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0359em;">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Ω</span></span></span></span></span>).</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b>Edges (<span class="math-inline" data-math="i \to j"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6595em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.854em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0572em;">j</span></span></span></span></span>):</b> Exist if <i>physically possible</i> under absolute bounds.</p><ul data-path-to-node="7,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,1,0,0">Check: <span class="math-inline" data-math="E_i + \tau_{ij} \le L_j"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">E</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9221em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1132em;">τ</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.1132em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0572em;">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≤</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">L</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0572em;">j</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,1,1,0">This prunes edges that are <i>never</i> possible (e.g., crossing the city in 1 minute).</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="8"><b>Crucially:</b> You do <b>not</b> run back-propagation here. You just check if the edge violates the laws of physics defined by the absolute windows.</p><h4 data-path-to-node="9">Layer 2: The Solver (The "Is It Actually Valid?" Layer)</h4><p data-path-to-node="10">When you add a new request (or a vehicle), you ask: <i>"Does there exist at least one Hamiltonian path in this graph?"</i></p><ul data-path-to-node="11"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0">Because <span class="math-inline" data-math="N"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.109em;">N</span></span></span></span></span> is small (<span class="math-inline" data-math="&lt; 10"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.5782em; vertical-align: -0.0391em;"></span><span class="mrel">&lt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">10</span></span></span></span></span> stops), you run a tiny DFS or Branch-and-Bound solver on the graph.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,0"><b>This solver</b> calculates the exact arrival times and slack for the specific sequence it is testing.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,2,0">If the solver finds <b>zero</b> valid paths, the graph is invalid <span class="math-inline" data-math="\rightarrow"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.3669em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span></span></span></span></span> Discard the Trip.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="12">2. Solving the "Vehicle Insertion" Problem</h3><p data-path-to-node="13">You are worried that: <i>"When inserting a vehicle... inserting the vehicles current stops will effect what path is optimal!"</i></p><p data-path-to-node="14"><b>Correct.</b> But you do not need to pre-calculate all permutations to solve this. The <b>Graph</b> <i>implicitly</i> contains all valid permutations.</p><p data-path-to-node="15">Here is the workflow for Vehicle Insertion:</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="16"><li><p data-path-to-node="16,0,0"><b>The Trip Graph (<span class="math-inline" data-math="G_{trip}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">G</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">r</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>):</b> You have a graph representing requests A and B. It contains edges for both orders (<span class="math-inline" data-math="A \to B"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span></span> and <span class="math-inline" data-math="B \to A"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span></span>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,1,0"><b>The Injection:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="16,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="16,1,1,0,0">You create a temporary <b>Contextual Graph</b> (<span class="math-inline" data-math="G_{final}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">G</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.1076em;">f</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">ina</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0197em;">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>) by adding the vehicle's fixed nodes (<span class="math-inline" data-math="S_1, S_2"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3011em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>) to <span class="math-inline" data-math="G_{trip}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">G</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3117em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">r</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">i</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,1,1,1,0">You add edges from <span class="math-inline" data-math="S_{last} \to \text{Graph Nodes}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0576em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0197em;">l</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">a</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">s</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">Graph&nbsp;Nodes</span></span></span></span></span></span> based on the "Loose Bounds" logic.</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,2,0"><b>The Query:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="16,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="16,2,1,0,0">You don't look up a pre-calculated permutation.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,2,1,1,0">You ask the <b>Solver</b>: <i>"Find the optimal path in <span class="math-inline" data-math="G_{final}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.9694em; vertical-align: -0.2861em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal">G</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.1076em;">f</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">ina</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0197em;">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2861em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>."</i></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,2,1,2,0">The solver explores the graph. Since the graph already pruned impossible edges (e.g., <span class="math-inline" data-math="B \to A"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span></span> was too slow), the solver only checks valid moves.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,2,1,3,0">The solver calculates the exact cost (slack/delay) for the paths it finds and returns the winner.</p></li></ul></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="17">3. Why this is efficient</h3><p data-path-to-node="18">You are replacing <b>Memory</b> (storing 1,000 permutations) with <b>Compute</b> (solving a small 8-node TSP on the fly).</p><ul data-path-to-node="19"><li><p data-path-to-node="19,0,0"><b>Memory:</b> You store 1 matrix per trip. (<span class="math-inline" data-math="O(N^2)"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.0641em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.109em;">N</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8141em;"><span class="" style="top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,1,0"><b>Compute:</b> Solving a TSP on 6-10 nodes is instantaneous (microseconds) because the "Time Window" constraints make the graph extremely sparse. Most branches of the DFS die immediately.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="20">Summary of the Revised Logic</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="21"><li><p data-path-to-node="21,0,0"><b>Don't Calculate Slack on the Graph.</b> It's mathematically impossible because of superposition.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="21,1,0"><b>Calculate "Reachability" on the Graph.</b> Store whether <span class="math-inline" data-math="i \to j"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6595em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.854em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0572em;">j</span></span></span></span></span> is <i>ever</i> possible.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="21,2,0"><b>Calculate Slack on the Path.</b> When you need to check if a trip is valid, or assign a vehicle, generate the path <i>then</i>.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="22"><b>The Algorithm Flow:</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c4195179700="" class="ng-tns-c4195179700-18 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="code-block ng-tns-c4195179700-18 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_9479edd882bd02b5&quot;,&quot;c_912d96631775c152&quot;,null,&quot;rc_0239ea383d66b22a&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="3" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c4195179700-18 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="ng-tns-c4195179700-18">Python</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="buttons ng-tns-c4195179700-18 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c4195179700-18 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_9479edd882bd02b5&quot;,&quot;c_912d96631775c152&quot;,null,&quot;rc_0239ea383d66b22a&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c4195179700-18"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c4195179700-18"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" class="ng-tns-c4195179700-18"><code _ngcontent-ng-c4195179700="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c4195179700-18"><span class="hljs-comment"># 1. GRAPH BUILD (Loose constraints)</span>
graph = BaseGraph()
graph.add_nodes(A, B)
<span class="hljs-comment"># Edges are added if Earliest(A) + drive &lt; Latest(B).</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># We don't know EXACT arrival at B yet, just that it's physically reachable.</span>

<span class="hljs-comment"># 2. VALIDITY CHECK (The "Solver")</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># We need to know: Is there ANY valid path through this graph?</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">not</span> solver.has_valid_path(graph):
    discard(trip)

<span class="hljs-comment"># 3. VEHICLE ASSIGNMENT (The "Optimization")</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># Vehicle V arrives.</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># We create a combined graph: V_nodes + Trip_nodes.</span>
combined_graph = graph.inject_vehicle(V)

<span class="hljs-comment"># We ask the solver for the BEST path, not just ANY path.</span>
best_path, score = solver.find_optimal_path(combined_graph)

<span class="hljs-comment"># NOW we have the exact slack for that specific best path.</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="24">This way, the Graph acts as a <b>Bloom Filter</b> (discarding obviously impossible connections), and the Solver acts as the <b>Precision Tool</b> (finding the exact schedule).</p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2587252621-7"></div></div><!----></response-container><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></share-turn-viewer><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c343160584="" class="ng-tns-c343160584-1 ng-star-inserted"><!----><share-turn-viewer _ngcontent-ng-c343160584="" _nghost-ng-c3025034799="" class="ng-tns-c343160584-1 ng-star-inserted" id="0ebc6352c3c71a82" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3025034799="" class="share-turn-viewer ng-star-inserted"><user-query _ngcontent-ng-c3025034799="" _nghost-ng-c3843244048="" class="ng-star-inserted"><span _ngcontent-ng-c3843244048="" class="user-query-container right-align-content"><!----><user-query-content _ngcontent-ng-c3843244048="" class="user-query-container" _nghost-ng-c3253035101="" style="--max-lines-for-collapse-count: 5;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="user-query-container user-query-bubble-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="file-preview-container ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-content ng-star-inserted" id="user-query-content-3" jslog="275422;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ucQahcKEwiJhIuHxqmRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQCg"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" mat-icon-button="" aria-label="Copy prompt" mattooltip="Copy prompt" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger action-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-controls="user-query-content-3" jslog="273008;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_0ebc6352c3c71a82&quot;,&quot;c_912d96631775c152&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-m action-button-icon google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="user-query-bubble-with-background ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="horizontal-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" role="heading" aria-level="2" class="query-text gds-body-l" dir="ltr"><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> # note on the alonso store all permutations; They dont <!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> you said Alonso save all permutations, but they solve  <!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> if travel(v,T1 ∪ T2) = valid then <!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted">  Tk ←T =T1∪T2  <!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> Add e(ri,T), ∀ri ∈ T, and e(T,v) <!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> So for each vehicle they basically have to check if the vehicle can pick up a subset of a passengers. Lets say we have two vehicles that are on the exact same spot. They can pick-up the exact same subsets. This is an inefficiency. <!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> # My problem tackling this! <!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> The problem I have with this is that we cannot reuse the hamilton path to make the next iteration faster! I have a hunch that we might be able to store all valid permutations. I think they will be pruned fast. If too many we could keep top K maybe we just keep top two per start node.  That way there will only be max be k*|request_set| permutations per graph. As the length of the request set grows the number of permutations will dwindle. <!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c3253035101="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></p><!----></div><!----><!----><!----></span></span><!----></div><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----></user-query-content></span></user-query><!----><response-container _ngcontent-ng-c3025034799="" class="response-container ng-tns-c2587252621-9 reduced-bottom-padding ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c2587252621=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container ng-tns-c2587252621-9 response-container-with-gpi ng-star-inserted response-container-has-multiple-responses" jslog="173900;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQzM4KahcKEwiJhIuHxqmRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQCw"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-header ng-tns-c2587252621-9 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-header-controls ng-tns-c2587252621-9"><!----><tts-control _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" _nghost-ng-c3197637580="" class="ng-tns-c2587252621-9 ng-trigger ng-trigger-singleResponseEnter ng-star-inserted ng-animate-disabled"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" class="response-tts-container ng-star-inserted" data-test-draft-id="rc_f7845d737b43d7f9" style="height: 3016px;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" data-test-id="disabled-tooltip" class="mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger tts-button-container mat-mdc-tooltip-disabled"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" mat-icon-button="" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger tts-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="Listen" jslog="184512;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[null,null,null,&quot;rc_f7845d737b43d7f9&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" role="img" fonticon="volume_up" class="mat-icon notranslate icon-filled google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="volume_up"></mat-icon><!----><!----><!----><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" role="menu" class="mat-mdc-menu-trigger playback-speed-menu-trigger multi" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false"><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3197637580="" yposition="below" xposition="after" class=""><!----></mat-menu></div><!----></tts-control><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-header-status ng-tns-c2587252621-9"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-header-processing-state ng-tns-c2587252621-9"></div></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="presented-response-container ng-tns-c2587252621-9" jslog="283401;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="2"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="avatar-gutter ng-tns-c2587252621-9 ng-star-inserted"><bard-avatar _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="avatar-component ng-tns-c1437199241-10 ng-tns-c2587252621-9 ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1437199241=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" bardavataranimationscontroller="" class="bard-avatar ng-tns-c1437199241-10"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" class="avatar-container ng-tns-c1437199241-10"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" class="avatar avatar_primary ng-tns-c1437199241-10 ng-trigger ng-trigger-botAvatarScaleDown ng-star-inserted"><bot-logo _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" class="ng-tns-c1437199241-10 is-dark-mode" _nghost-ng-c1731379540="" style="--bot-logo-size: 32px; --bot-logo-icon-size: 18px; --bot-logo-text: #25B2D4; --bot-logo-bg: #00404E; --bot-logo-border: #00404E;"><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1731379540="" class="bot-logo-text sidenav-style-updates ng-star-inserted" style=""> R <!----><!----></div><!----></bot-logo></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1437199241="" lottie-animation="" class="avatar_spinner_animation ng-tns-c1437199241-10" style="opacity: 0; visibility: hidden;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="32" height="32" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px); content-visibility: visible;"><defs><clipPath id="__lottie_element_89"><rect width="32" height="32" x="0" y="0"></rect></clipPath><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_93" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_100" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_104" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_108" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_112" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></linearGradient><linearGradient id="__lottie_element_116" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x1="-16" y1="0" x2="16" y2="0"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="50%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop></linearGradient></defs><g clip-path="url(#__lottie_element_89)"><g transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,16,16)" opacity="1" style="display: block;"><g opacity="1" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)"><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_116)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="2" d=" M-4.383999824523926,-14.347999572753906 C-2.996999979019165,-14.772000312805176 -1.524999976158142,-15 0,-15 C0,-15 0,-15 0,-15 C1.7100000381469727,-15 3.3540000915527344,-14.713000297546387 4.886000156402588,-14.1850004196167"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_112)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_108)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_104)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_100)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_93)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g></g></svg></div></div></bard-avatar><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c2587252621-9"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="bot-name gds-title-s ng-tns-c2587252621-9 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="bot-name-text ng-tns-c2587252621-9"> Ride-Sharing </div><span _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="bot-name-ugc-label ng-tns-c2587252621-9 ng-star-inserted">Custom Gem</span><!----><bot-experiment-badge _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="ng-tns-c2587252621-9" _nghost-ng-c3108469367=""><!----></bot-experiment-badge></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3025034799="" class="message-content ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c793834718=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c793834718="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">You are absolutely correct to call out that inefficiency in the standard implementation. You have identified exactly where the "stateless" nature of the Alonso-Mora algorithm burns CPU cycles.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="1">1. The Alonso-Mora Reality Check</h3><p data-path-to-node="2">You are right. In the original paper, the <code>travel(v, T)</code> function is a "black box" solver.</p><ul data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><span data-path-to-node="3,0,0,0"><span class="citation-3"></span></span><span data-path-to-node="3,0,0,1"><span class="citation-3">It performs an exhaustive search (for low capacity) or heuristic search (for high capacity) </span><i><span class="citation-3">every time</span></i><span class="citation-3"> it is called</span></span><span data-path-to-node="3,0,0,2"><span class="citation-3 citation-end-3"><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2271939537=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2271939537="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="1"><!----></sup></source-footnote><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2271939537=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2271939537="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="1"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></span><span data-path-to-node="3,0,0,3">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c48347833=""><!----><source-inline-chips _ngcontent-ng-c48347833="" _nghost-ng-c2631690858="" class="ng-star-inserted"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="3"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="4"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="5"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="6"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----></source-inline-chips><!----><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><span data-path-to-node="3,1,0,0">It does <b>not</b> persist the route structure from the previous step (<span class="math-inline" data-math="k-1"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7778em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">−</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span></span>). </span><span data-path-to-node="3,1,0,1"><span class="citation-2"></span></span><span data-path-to-node="3,1,0,2"><span class="citation-2">It only uses the existence of the subtrips (</span><span class="math-inline" data-math="T \setminus \{r\}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;"><span class="citation-2">T</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin"><span class="citation-2">∖</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen"><span class="citation-2">{</span></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;"><span class="citation-2">r</span></span><span class="mclose"><span class="citation-2">}</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="citation-2">) as a feasibility check (the Apriori property) to decide </span><i><span class="citation-2">whether</span></i><span class="citation-2"> to run the solver</span></span><span data-path-to-node="3,1,0,3"><span class="citation-2 citation-end-2"><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2271939537=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2271939537="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="2"><!----></sup></source-footnote><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2271939537=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2271939537="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="2"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></span><span data-path-to-node="3,1,0,4">.</span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c48347833=""><!----><source-inline-chips _ngcontent-ng-c48347833="" _nghost-ng-c2631690858="" class="ng-star-inserted"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="7"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="8"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="9"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="10"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----></source-inline-chips><!----><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><b>The Inefficiency:</b> If 10 vehicles are near each other, or if you simply move from checking sets of size 3 to size 4, the algorithm discards the valid topological sort it found for size 3 and re-solves the TSP for size 4 from scratch.</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="4">2. Your Solution: "Persistent Permutations"</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">Your hunch is correct: <b>We should store the valid permutations.</b>
Because of the strict <b>Pickup <span class="math-inline" data-math="\to"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.3669em;"></span><span class="mrel">→</span></span></span></span></span> Dropoff</b> constraints and tight <b>Time Windows</b> (e.g., maximum waiting time <span class="math-inline" data-math="\Omega"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Ω</span></span></span></span></span>), the number of valid permutations does not explode factorially; it stays manageable. This allows us to use <b>Insertion</b> instead of <b>Solving</b>.</p><p data-path-to-node="6">Here is how we mathematize your "store all permutations" idea into an efficient <b>Incremental Build</b>.</p><h4 data-path-to-node="7">The Core Logic: Extension by Insertion</h4><p data-path-to-node="8">Let <span class="math-inline" data-math="\Pi_k"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> be the set of <i>all valid permutations</i> for a group of requests <span class="math-inline" data-math="R_k"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0077em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.
Instead of running a TSP solver on <span class="math-inline" data-math="R_{k+1} = R_k \cup \{r_{new}\}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8917em; vertical-align: -0.2083em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0077em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span><span class="mbin mtight">+</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0077em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∪</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">{</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">r</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0269em;">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">}</span></span></span></span></span>, we simply iterate through the stored permutations in <span class="math-inline" data-math="\Pi_k"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> and try to <b>insert</b> the new request's Origin (<span class="math-inline" data-math="O_{new}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0269em;">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>) and Destination (<span class="math-inline" data-math="D_{new}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0269em;">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>).</p><p data-path-to-node="9"><b>The Inductive Step:</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="10"><li><p data-path-to-node="10,0,0"><b>Load:</b> Retrieve the list of valid permutations for the subset <span class="math-inline" data-math="R_k"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0077em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0077em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> (which you already computed).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,0"><b>Insert:</b> For each permutation <span class="math-inline" data-math="P \in \Pi_k"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7224em; vertical-align: -0.0391em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">P</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">∈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>:</p><ul data-path-to-node="10,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,1,0,0">Try inserting <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_{new}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0269em;">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> at every valid index <span class="math-inline" data-math="i"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6595em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,1,1,0">Try inserting <span class="math-inline" data-math="D_{new}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.1514em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">n</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">e</span><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0269em;">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> at every valid index <span class="math-inline" data-math="j &gt; i"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.854em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0572em;">j</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&gt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6595em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">i</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,1,2,0">Check validity (Slack/Time constraints).</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,2,0"><b>Store:</b> If valid, save this new permutation into <span class="math-inline" data-math="\Pi_{k+1}"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8917em; vertical-align: -0.2083em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span><span class="mbin mtight">+</span><span class="mord mtight">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.2083em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li></ol><h4 data-path-to-node="11">Why this is faster (The Math)</h4><ul data-path-to-node="12"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,0,0"><b>Alonso (Standard):</b> solving TSP for size <span class="math-inline" data-math="k+1"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7778em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span></span>. Complexity <span class="math-inline" data-math="\approx O((2k+2)!)"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4831em;"></span><span class="mrel">≈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="mopen">((</span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mclose">)!)</span></span></span></span></span> in worst case (though constraints help).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,0"><b>Your Approach:</b> <span class="math-inline" data-math="(2k+1) \times (2k+2) \approx O(k^2)"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">×</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">+</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≈</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.0641em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8141em;"><span class="" style="top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span> insertion checks per stored permutation.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="13">Since the number of valid permutations is heavily pruned by the "Time Window" constraints (e.g., you can't pick up A, drive 10 mins, pick up B, and still drop A on time), the number of survivors in <span class="math-inline" data-math="\Pi_k"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Π</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> is usually very small (often <span class="math-inline" data-math="&lt; 5"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.5782em; vertical-align: -0.0391em;"></span><span class="mrel">&lt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">5</span></span></span></span></span>).</p><h3 data-path-to-node="14">3. The Architecture: The "Permutation Cache"</h3><p data-path-to-node="15">We replace the Boolean "is_feasible" map with a <b>Topology Map</b>.</p><p data-path-to-node="16"><b>Data Structure:</b>
<code>Map&lt; TripSet_ID, List[RouteTopology] &gt;</code></p><ul data-path-to-node="17"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,0,0"><b>Key:</b> <code>FrozenSet({Req_A, Req_B, Req_C})</code> (The "What")</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,1,0"><b>Value:</b> <code>List</code> of valid <code>RouteTopology</code> objects (The "How")</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="18"><b>Refined Build Process:</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="19"><li><p data-path-to-node="19,0,0"><b>Size <span class="math-inline" data-math="k=1"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">1</span></span></span></span></span>:</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="19,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="19,0,1,0,0">For Request A: Store <code>[ (O_A, D_A) ]</code>.</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,1,0"><b>Size <span class="math-inline" data-math="k=2"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">2</span></span></span></span></span> (Merge A and B):</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="19,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="19,1,1,0,0">Retrieve <code>[ (O_A, D_A) ]</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,1,1,1,0">Insert <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_B, D_B"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> into it.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,1,1,2,0"><i>Resulting Valid List:</i> <code>[ (O_A, O_B, D_A, D_B), (O_B, O_A, D_A, D_B) ]</code> (assuming others failed time checks).</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,2,0"><b>Size <span class="math-inline" data-math="k=3"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">3</span></span></span></span></span> (Merge {A,B} and C):</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="19,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="19,2,1,0,0">Retrieve the list from Step 2.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,2,1,1,0">Insert <span class="math-inline" data-math="O_C, D_C"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0715em;">C</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0715em;">C</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> into the surviving permutations.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="19,2,1,2,0">You <b>never</b> resolve the relationship between A and B. You essentially "reuse" the Hamiltonian path segment you already validated.</p></li></ul></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="20">4. Handling the "Pruning" (Top-K)</h3><p data-path-to-node="21">You mentioned: <i>"If too many we could keep top K... maybe K per start node."</i></p><p data-path-to-node="22">This is a smart heuristic to prevent memory bloat, but you likely won't even need strict K-capping because of <b>constraint pruning</b>.</p><p data-path-to-node="23"><b>Why it naturally dwindles:</b>
Every new request adds 2 new constraints (Pickup Window, Dropoff Window).</p><ul data-path-to-node="24"><li><p data-path-to-node="24,0,0">A permutation like <span class="math-inline" data-math="(O_A, O_B, O_C, D_A \dots)"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0502em;">B</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">O</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.0715em;">C</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0278em;">D</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3283em;"><span class="" style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0278em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">A</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span class=""></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="minner">…</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span></span> implies <span class="math-inline" data-math="A"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span></span> is in the car for a long time.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="24,1,0">If <span class="math-inline" data-math="A"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">A</span></span></span></span></span>'s max delay is 5 mins, this permutation becomes invalid immediately.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="24,2,0">Therefore, as <span class="math-inline" data-math="k"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.0315em;">k</span></span></span></span></span> increases, the "density" of valid permutations drops. You are unlikely to find 100 valid ways to route 4 people in one car; usually, there are only 1 or 2 ways that satisfy everyone's patience limits.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="25"><b>Recommendation:</b>
Store <b>all</b> valid permutations found during the insertion phase. If the count exceeds a safety limit (e.g., 20), drop the ones with the lowest "Slack Score" (tightest schedule), as they are least likely to accept a new passenger later.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="26">5. Final Workflow with Vehicle Context</h3><p data-path-to-node="27">This fixes your original inefficiency about the "two vehicles at the same spot."</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="28"><li><p data-path-to-node="28,0,0"><b>Global Phase (The "Request" Graph):</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="28,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="28,0,1,0,0">Build the <code>TripSet -&gt; List[Permutations]</code> map purely based on request constraints (Virtual Vehicle starting at <span class="math-inline" data-math="t=0"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6151em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span></span>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="28,0,1,1,0">This is done <b>once</b> for all vehicles.</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="28,1,0"><b>Assignment Phase (The "Vehicle" Context):</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="28,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="28,1,1,0,0">For a specific vehicle <span class="math-inline" data-math="V"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;">V</span></span></span></span></span> and a Trip <span class="math-inline" data-math="T"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">T</span></span></span></span></span>:</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="28,1,1,1,0">Fetch <code>List[Permutations]</code> for <span class="math-inline" data-math="T"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;">T</span></span></span></span></span>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="28,1,1,2,0"><span class="citation-1"></span></p><p data-path-to-node="28,1,1,2,1"><span data-path-to-node="28,1,1,2,1,0"><b><span class="citation-1">Check:</span></b><span class="citation-1"> Can </span><span class="math-inline" data-math="V"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"><span class="citation-1">V</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="citation-1"> reach the </span><code><span class="citation-1">first_node</span></code><span class="citation-1"> of Permutation </span><span class="math-inline" data-math="P"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.1389em;"><span class="citation-1">P</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="citation-1"> by </span><code><span class="citation-1">P.earliest_start</span></code><span class="citation-1">? </span></span><span data-path-to-node="28,1,1,2,1,1"><span class="citation-1 citation-end-1"><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2271939537=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2271939537="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="3"><!----></sup></source-footnote><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2271939537=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2271939537="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="3"><!----></sup></source-footnote><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2271939537=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2271939537="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="3"><!----></sup></source-footnote><source-footnote ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c2271939537=""><sup _ngcontent-ng-c2271939537="" class="superscript" data-turn-source-index="3"><!----></sup></source-footnote></span></span><sources-carousel-inline ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER" _nghost-ng-c48347833=""><!----><source-inline-chips _ngcontent-ng-c48347833="" _nghost-ng-c2631690858="" class="ng-star-inserted"><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="11"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="12"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="13"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="14"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><source-inline-chip _ngcontent-ng-c2631690858="" _nghost-ng-c892417312="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" class="source-inline-chip-container ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" cdkoverlayorigin="" class="button ng-star-inserted" jslog="262206;track:generic_click,impression,attention" data-hveid="15"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c892417312="" role="img" fonticon="link" class="mat-icon notranslate symbol gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="link"></mat-icon><!----></button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></source-inline-chip><!----></source-inline-chips><!----><!----><!----><!----></sources-carousel-inline></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="28,1,1,3,0">You do <b>not</b> resolve the TSP. You just check the "connection" edge from Vehicle to Permutation Start.</p></li></ul></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="29">This effectively decouples the "Combinatorial Optimization" (finding valid sequences of people) from the "Resource Allocation" (assigning a specific car).</p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2587252621="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2587252621-9"></div></div><!----></response-container><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></share-turn-viewer><!----></div><!----></div>